{"articleNo":"1462","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1462&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"전자의료기기 부품소재 산업화기반 구축사업 선정","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.10.29","hit":"12058","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<br><br><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\"><strong><font color=\"#3366ff\">전자의료기기 부품소재 산업화기반 구축사업 선정<br>정부 예비타당성조사 통과</font></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 17pt; COLOR: #aeaeae; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 17pt; COLOR: #aeaeae; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 1.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -1.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br>&nbsp; <strong>우리대학</strong>이</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 지식경제부, 경상북도, 구미시, 한국산업단지공단과 함께 추진해온 <font color=\"#ff00ff\"><strong>“</strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font color=\"#ff00ff\"><strong>전자의료기기 부품소재 산업화기반 구축사업</strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font color=\"#ff00ff\"><strong>”</strong></font>이 국책사업으로 기획재정부에서 최종 확정되었다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 1.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -1.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 전자의료기기 부품소재 산업화 기반구축사업은 2011부터 5년간 1,377억원을 지원받아 생산단지 조성, 상용화지원센터 설립 및 전자의료기기 부품소재 상용화 기술개발을 지원할 계획이며, 이를 통하여 구미지역은 첨단 전자의료기기 산업의 메카로 거듭날 것으로 기대된다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 1.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -1.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 1.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -1.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">▶ 주요사업내용</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 25.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>○ 전자의료기기 부품소재 상용화지원센터 설립 (금오공대)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 25.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>- Open Innovation 형태의 산학연 공동 연구 및 공동 장비활용</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 25.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>- 비즈니스 및 컨설팅 지원체계 구축, 의공학 전문인력 재교육</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 25.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>○ 전자의료기기 부품소재 생산단지 조성 (구미 1공단)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 25.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>- 연면적 31,675<img height=\"16\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/FCKeditor/editor/PIC160.gif\" width=\"17\" border=\"0\">의 친환경 의료기기 지식산업단지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 25.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>- 지역 및 국내외 글로벌 의료기기 부품소재 기업 유치</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 25.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>○ IT융합 전자의료기기 부품소재 상용화기술 개발 (R&amp;DB)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 25.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -25.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>- 5개분야 부품소재 상용화기술 개발</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 7.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -7.6pt\"><font color=\"#3366ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font color=\"#3366ff\">☞ 문의:</font> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">전자의료기기 부품소재 산업화기반 구축사업 추진단</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 7.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -7.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font color=\"#3366ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(조설아 연구원, 054-478-7937)<br><br></font><br><br><br><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
